      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not a bug, this is documented in the [VRChat 2026.4.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202641) - October 28 - Build 1936 release notes.\n\n> ⚠️ This release is NOT network compatible! You will be unable to join users that have not updated their client! If you see, \"Can't Join Instance,\" that's why!⚠\n\nThe missing Steam Frame update has been previously reported: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/forgotten-apk-update-upload-on-steam",
