  "details": "Description\n\nupon accepting invites of other people the game will not let you join due to an outdated version. you can only join other frame users.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nstart game on standalone steam frame.\n\ntry join a user on another platform\n\nexpected: you join your friends instance\n\ninstead: game fails to connect with error message\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: SteamFrame (platform: Android - SteamFrame, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-cc121c45ee-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-29_02-50-14.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_4e4d27c0-b0a1-441b-9e0d-751a8913e9eb/1/file)",
